{"page":72,"verses":[{"verse_key":"3:166","surah":3,"ayah":166,"ar_uthmani":"وَمَآ أَصَـٰبَكُمْ يَوْمَ ٱلْتَقَى ٱلْجَمْعَانِ فَبِإِذْنِ ٱللَّهِ وَلِيَعْلَمَ ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"what befell you on the day the two armies met in battle happened with God’s permission and in order for Him to see who were the true believers and who were the hypocrites who,","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمَآ","en_gloss":"And what","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"3:166"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَصَـٰبَكُمْ","en_gloss":"struck you","transliteration":"aṣābakum","verse_key":"3:166"},{"pos":3,"ar":"يَوْمَ","en_gloss":"(on the) day","transliteration":"yawma","verse_key":"3:166"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْتَقَى","en_gloss":"(when) met","transliteration":"l-taqā","verse_key":"3:166"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْجَمْعَانِ","en_gloss":"the two hosts","transliteration":"l-jamʿāni","verse_key":"3:166"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فَبِإِذْنِ","en_gloss":"(was) by (the) permission","transliteration":"fabi-idh'ni","verse_key":"3:166"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"3:166"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَلِيَعْلَمَ","en_gloss":"and that He (might) make evident","transliteration":"waliyaʿlama","verse_key":"3:166"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","en_gloss":"the believers","transliteration":"l-mu'minīna","verse_key":"3:166"},{"pos":10,"ar":"١٦٦","en_gloss":"(166)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"3:166"}]},{"verse_key":"3:167","surah":3,"ayah":167,"ar_uthmani":"وَلِيَعْلَمَ ٱلَّذِينَ نَافَقُوا۟ ۚ وَقِيلَ لَهُمْ تَعَالَوْا۟ قَـٰتِلُوا۟ فِى سَبِيلِ ٱللَّهِ أَوِ ٱدْفَعُوا۟ ۖ قَالُوا۟ لَوْ نَعْلَمُ قِتَالًا لَّٱتَّبَعْنَـٰكُمْ ۗ هُمْ لِلْكُفْرِ يَوْمَئِذٍ أَقْرَبُ مِنْهُمْ لِلْإِيمَـٰنِ ۚ يَقُولُونَ بِأَفْوَٰهِهِم مَّا لَيْسَ فِى قُلُوبِهِمْ ۗ وَٱللَّهُ أَعْلَمُ بِمَا يَكْتُمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"when it was said to them, ‘Come, fight for God’s cause, or at least defend yourselves,’ answered, ‘We would follow you if we knew there was going to be fighting.’ On that d