":"Those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"3:168"},{"pos":2,"ar":"قَالُوا۟","en_gloss":"said","transliteration":"qālū","verse_key":"3:168"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لِإِخْوَٰنِهِمْ","en_gloss":"about their brothers","transliteration":"li-ikh'wānihim","verse_key":"3:168"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَقَعَدُوا۟","en_gloss":"while they sat","transliteration":"waqaʿadū","verse_key":"3:168"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لَوْ","en_gloss":"If","transliteration":"law","verse_key":"3:168"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَطَاعُونَا","en_gloss":"they (had) obeyed us","transliteration":"aṭāʿūnā","verse_key":"3:168"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"3:168"},{"pos":8,"ar":"قُتِلُوا۟ ۗ","en_gloss":"they would have been killed","transliteration":"qutilū","verse_key":"3:168"},{"pos":9,"ar":"قُلْ","en_gloss":"Say","transliteration":"qul","verse_key":"3:168"},{"pos":10,"ar":"فَٱدْرَءُوا۟","en_gloss":"Then avert","transliteration":"fa-id'raū","verse_key":"3:168"},{"pos":11,"ar":"عَنْ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"ʿan","verse_key":"3:168"},{"pos":12,"ar":"أَنفُسِكُمُ","en_gloss":"yourselves","transliteration":"anfusikumu","verse_key":"3:168"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلْمَوْتَ","en_gloss":"[the] death","transliteration":"l-mawta","verse_key":"3:168"},{"pos":14,"ar":"إِن","en_gloss":"if","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"3:168"},{"pos":15,"ar":"كُنتُمْ","en_gloss":"you are","transliteration":"kuntum","verse_key":"3:168"},{"pos":16,"ar":"صَـٰدِقِينَ","en_gloss":"truthful","transliteration":"ṣādiqīna","verse_key":"3:168"},{"pos":17,"ar":"١٦٨","en_gloss":"(168)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"3:168"}]},{"verse_key":"3:169","surah":3,"ayah":169,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَا تَحْسَبَنَّ ٱلَّذِينَ قُتِلُوا۟ فِى سَبِيلِ ٱللَّهِ أَمْوَٰتًۢا ۚ بَلْ أَحْيَآءٌ عِندَ رَبِّهِمْ يُرْزَقُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"[Prophet], do not think of those who have been killed in God’s way as dead. They are alive with their Lord, well provided for,","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"And (do) not","